  "title": "Celebrating Pride with Our Twin Cities Community",
  "summary": "As Pride Month comes to a close, Sun Country is proud to reflect on this past weekend spent celebrating with our hometown community at the Twin Cities Pride Parade.Employees, family members, friends, and colleagues came together in downtown Minneapolis to walk the parade route, connect with the crowd, and show support for the LGBTQ+ community. It was a colorful, high-energy day filled with plenty of smiles, Sun Country spirit, and moments that reminded us why showing up matters.For Sun Country,",
